        <mxCell id="n3" value="Single AWS account, us-east-1. Drawn from the &lt;b&gt;benefits_eligibility_agent&lt;/b&gt; pack at tag &lt;b&gt;v0.6.0-pilot-rc1&lt;/b&gt; — the one tree a full-portfolio gate passed 15/15 from zero (2026-09-07, env &lt;b&gt;ben-fp&lt;/b&gt;, two tenants, real AgentCore Runtime). Evidence: &lt;b&gt;evidence/FULL-PORTFOLIO-GATE-2026-09-07.json&lt;/b&gt;." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=10;fontColor=#3C4043;" parent="1" vertex="1">
