        <mxCell id="n70" value="breach engages" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=9;fontColor=#3C4043;strokeColor=#5F6368;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=blockThin;endFill=1;dashed=1;" parent="1" edge="1" source="n51" target="n50">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n71" value="&lt;b&gt;WHAT THIS DIAGRAM DOES NOT CLAIM.&lt;/b&gt; &amp;nbsp;(1) All evidence is &lt;b&gt;author-produced on one AWS account&lt;/b&gt; — the repository names this its single biggest credibility gap and ships an Independent Verification Protocol to close it. &amp;nbsp;(2) &lt;b&gt;main is 23 commits ahead&lt;/b&gt; of the gated tag; the 15/15 result describes the tag, not today's tree. &amp;nbsp;(3) No &lt;b&gt;real system of record&lt;/b&gt; has ever been governed — every run used synthetic data. &amp;nbsp;(4) Object Lock &lt;b&gt;COMPLIANCE&lt;/b&gt; mode has never been deployed. &amp;nbsp;(5) Of four vertical packs only &lt;b&gt;benefits&lt;/b&gt; is live-gated; housing wires 3 of 17 controls. &amp;nbsp;(6) &lt;b&gt;488&lt;/b&gt; checkov findings are baselined across the portfolio. &amp;nbsp;(7) No penetration test, DR exercise, or SLO has been run." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=10;fontColor=#B31412;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="1015" width="1560" height="74" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>
